{"products":[{"id":8921463652583,"title":"Apartments \u0026 Inflation Dark Grey Crop Tee","handle":"apartments-inflation-screen-print-on-lavender-crop-t-shirt","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eApartments \u0026amp; Inflation captures the quiet pressure of living in New York—where housing, cost, ambition, \u0026amp; survival are stacked on top of each other. The graphic pulls from medical iconography \u0026amp; city infrastructure, turning apartment buildings into a symbol of strain, resilience, \u0026amp; the constant balancing act of making it work.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThere’s even a quiet nod to sanitation—because in this city, somebody has to take the trash out, whether it’s physical, financial, or emotional. Clean streets don’t happen by accident \u0026amp; neither does staying afloat.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCut cropped \u0026amp; confident, this tee hits with intention. It’s soft but not flimsy; expressive without trying too hard. Worn on its own or layered, it feels right for city days, long walks, \u0026amp; moments when style carries meaning.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDetails-\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e100% ring-spun cotton\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSoft hand feel with a lived-in finish\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCropped, feminine silhouette\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight \u0026amp; breathable for everyday wear\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDurable print built to last\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2024-06-15T20:48:15-04:00","created_at":"2024-06-15T20:48:15-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00","vendor":"PJ O'Rourke","product_type":"","tags":["Apartments \u0026 Inflation","Sc