ongs there, because it does. Equal parts anatomy class \u0026amp; romance, it’s for girls who lead with feeling, think with intention, \u0026amp; move through the city by instinct.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWear it when your heart’s racing, when you’re falling in love (perhaps with New York), or when you just need a reminder that everything good starts with circulation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCute. Smart. A little vulnerable.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFully alive.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDetails-\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e100% ringspun cotton\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSoft, breathable feel with a smooth finish\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeminine cropped silhouette\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight \u0026amp; easy for warm days or layered nights\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned to move with you—heartbeat included\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2025-09-09T20:22:35-04:00","created_at":"2025-09-09T20:20:44-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00","vendor":"PJ O'Rourke","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":51363340550375,"title":"S","option1":"S","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"55.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9340646686951,"created_at":"2025-09-09T20:22:05-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51363340583143,"title":"M","option1":"M","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"55.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position"