3021\/files\/arteries-crop-tee-model-back.png?v=1768528102","width":1321,"height":1302}],"options":[{"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL"]}]},{"id":9436850913511,"title":"Layer Cake of NY Crop Tee","handle":"layer-cake-of-new-york-crop-tee","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLayer Cake of New York reveals the city the way it’s actually lived; stacked, layered, chaotic, \u0026amp; beautiful. The illustration cuts New York in cross-section, showing iconic buildings above ground \u0026amp; the hidden systems below; subways, tunnels, movement, \u0026amp; stories all coexisting in one vertical slice.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePrinted on a crisp white 100% ringspun cotton crop tee, the contrast feels light, graphic, \u0026amp; intentional. The cropped silhouette keeps it modern \u0026amp; feminine, while the artwork carries depth; playful at first glance, thoughtful the longer you look. It’s the kind of piece that balances softness with structure, ease with meaning.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis tee feels right walking through SoHo on a sunny afternoon, sitting on the steps in Union Square, biking along the West Side Highway, or wandering Greenwich Village where old New York still peeks through. It works just as naturally in front of historic facades, brownstones, \u0026amp; corner cafés as it does layered into everyday city life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNew York isn’t flat.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIt’s layered.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis is the slice you wear.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDetails\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e100% ringspun cotton\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSoft, breathable feel with a smooth finish\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeminine cropped silhouette\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight \u0026amp; easy for warm days or layered looks\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOriginal Layer Cake of New York artwork\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-10T10:24:23-05:00","created_at":"2026-01-10T10:24:23-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00","vendor":"PJ O'Rourke","product_type":"","tags":["Screen Print"],"variants":[{"id":51705474646247,"title":"Small","option1":"Small","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9436850913511,"created_at":"2026-01-10T10:24:23-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51705474679015,"title":"Medium","option1":"Medium","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":2,"product_id":9436850913511,"created_at":"2026-01-10T10:24:23-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51705474711783,"title":"Large","option1":"Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":3,"product_id":9436850913511,"created_at":"2026-01-10T10:24:23-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51705474744551,"title":"X-Large","option1":"X-Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":4,"product_id":9436850913511,"created_at":"2026-01-10T10:24:23-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51705474777319,"title":"X