w York Kicks Crop Tee","handle":"new-york-kicks-dark-grey-crop-tee","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNew York Kicks reclaims street energy through a feminine lens; confident, effortless, \u0026amp; unapologetically at ease. Cropped just right; it sits with intention; showing strength without forcing it. The graphic pulls from classic New York iconography; sneakers laced tight; city pride worn loud; but the fit tells a different story; lighter, freer, \u0026amp; made to move with you.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis isn’t oversized bravado or borrowed masculinity; it’s New York style distilled; cool without trying; tough without hardness; expressive without noise. The crop hits clean at the waist; balancing edge with elegance; whether you’re walking through a park; ducking into a café; or owning the sidewalk without saying a word.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSoft to the touch but strong in presence; this tee feels lived-in from the first wear. It’s the kind of piece that doesn’t ask for attention; but always gets it.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDetails-\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e100% ring-spun cotton\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSoft, breathable feel with a natural drape\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeminine cropped silhouette\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight, easy, \u0026amp; street-ready\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for movement, confidence, \u0026amp; everyday wear\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-08T17:53:13-05:00","created_at":"2026-01-08T17:52:58-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00","vendor":"PJ O'Rourke","product_type":"","tags":["Apartments \u0026 Inflation","Screen Print"],"variants":[{"id":51685539152103,"title":"Small","option1":"Small","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"50.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":2,"product_id":9434972586215,"created_at":"2026-01-08T17:52:58-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51685539184871,"title":"Medium","option1":"Medium","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"50.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":3,"product_id":9434972586215,"created_at":"2026-01-08T17:52:58-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51685539217639,"title":"Large","option1":"Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"50.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":4,"product_id":9434972586215,"created_at":"2026-01-08T17:52:58-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51685539250407,"title":"X-Large","option1":"X-Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"50.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":5,"product_id":9434972586215,"created_at":"2026-01-08T17:52:58-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51685539283175,"title":"XX-Large","option1":"XX-Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"50.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":6,"product_id":9434972586215,"created_at":"2026-01-08T17:52:58-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":48893784031463,"created_at":"2026-01-17T11:39:55-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-01-17T11:40:14-05:00","product_id":9434972586215,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/IMG-7764.png?v=1768668014","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["Small","Medium","Large","X-Large","XX-Large"]}]},{"id":9441107312871,"title":"New York Fuckery Crop Tee","handle":"new-york-fuckery-crop-tee","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA civic joke, staged on sacred ground.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eShot in front of the \u003ca href=\"chatgpt:\/\/generic-entity?number=0\"\u003eWoolworth Building\u003c\/a\u003e—the Cathedral of Commerce, famously paid for in cash—this crop tee sets old-money grandeur against modern-day absurdity. Gothic spires loom. Bureaucracy smirks back.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe graphic mashes up the visual language of the Lottery and the MTA, twisting familiar civic symbols into a blunt, wearable truth: in this city, chaos is policy and luck is a transit line that may or may not arrive. The clash is the point. Reverence meets parody. Power meets punchline.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCut from 100% cotton, 4oz. fabric, the tee is lightweight and cropped with intent—clean, confident, and unapologetic. It wears like a protest sign you don’t have to explain. Sharp contrast. Sharp message. No filler.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt for summer streets, courthouse steps, and anyone fluent in New York irony.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDetails\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e4oz. 100% cotton crop tee\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight, breathable feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCropped, feminine silhouette\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBold black-and-white graphic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned to clash—architecturally and culturally\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNew York built cathedrals for commerce.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThen it built systems to mess with you.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis is what happens when they meet.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-17T10:25:03-05:00","created_at":"2026-01-17T10:17:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00","vendor":"PJ O'Rourke","product_type":"","tags":["Screen Print"],"variants":[{"id":51723158520039,"title":"Small","option1":"Small","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9441107312871,"created_at":"2026-01-17T10:17:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51723158552807,"title":"Medium","option1":"Medium","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":2,"product_id":9441107312871,"created_at":"2026-01-17T10:17:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51723158585575,"title":"Large","option1":"Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":3,"product_id":9441107312871,"created_at":"2026-01-17T10:17:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51723158618343,"title":"X-Large","option1":"X-Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":4,"product_id":9441107312871,"created_at":"2026-01-17T10:17:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51723158651111,"title":"XX-Large","option1":"XX-Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":5,"product_id":9441107312871,"created_at":"2026-01-17T10:17:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"},{"id":51723158683879,"title":"XXX-Large","option1":"XXX-Large","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":6,"product_id":9441107312871,"created_at":"2026-01-17T10:17:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":48895764463847,"created_at":"2026-01-17T20:53:58-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-01-17T20:53:59-05:00","product_id":9441107312871,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/IMG-7853.png?v=1768701239","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":48910502756583,"created_at":"2026-01-20T12:29:24-05:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-01-20T12:29:25-05:00","product_id":9441107312871,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/fuckery-crop-back-signature-white-crop-tee.png?v=1768930165","width":1321,"height":1302}],"options":[{"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["Small","Medium","Large","X-Large","XX-Large","XXX-Large"]}]},{"id":9433742246119,"title":"Brooklyn Cassettes Crop Tee","handle":"new-york-city-arteries-crop-tee-copy","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrooklyn Cassettes is a love song to analog days; when music lived in pockets, playlists were handmade, \u0026amp; rewinding took patience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe graphic nods to old-school tapes, vinyl crates, liner notes, \u0026amp; the ritual of pressing play with intention. Set in a bold Swordfish-style font, the lettering feels sharp, timeless, \u0026amp; slightly rebellious; like album art you’d recognize from across the room. It carries that perfect mix of toughness \u0026amp; softness that Brooklyn has always done best.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCut into a feminine crop, the tee feels easy, flattering, \u0026amp; lived-in from the first wear. Lightweight \u0026amp; breathable, it sits comfortably on the body without trying too hard; made for walking tree-lined blocks, stopping into record shops, \u0026amp; catching afternoon sun on a stoop.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrooklyn in the spring, windows open. Music drifting out onto the sidewalk. Layers coming off. The city warming back up \u0026amp; finding its rhythm again. This is the kind of tee you throw on without thinking; because it already feels like part of you.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDetails\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e100% ringspun cotton\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSoft, breathable feel with a smooth finish\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeminine cropped silhouette\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight \u0026amp; easy for warm days or layered nights\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-07T17:36:33-05:00","created_at":"2026-01-07T17:36:33-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:00","vendor":"PJ O'Rourke","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":51680760856807,"title":"S","option1":"S","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"55.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9433742246119,"created_at":"2026-01-07T17:36:34-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:33:41-04:0